  "title": "Qualify complete current local Math packages and two isolated consumers without publication",
  "commitMessage": "docs: qualify full local Math package inventory and isolated clients",
  "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
  "projectNodes": [
    "M7"
  ],
  "contribution": {
    "summary": "Qualify the complete thirteen-package local Math net10 delivery graph from one current source tree, without publication. Rebuild the solution, pack and inspect all thirteen preview libraries, and execute existing independent M3 statistics/numerics and exact quantity consumers using a single offline feed and isolated NuGet cache. Preserve M0–M7 completion with zero new achievements.",
    "value": "The BCL-only read-only gate checks current thirteen PackageIds/versions/direct dependencies and actual ZIP/nuspec/net10 DLL identities, exact source-only M3 and quantity consumers, RS126 first-pass lineage and unchanged 541-node Math plan. Twenty bounded local commands rebuild and repack all thirteen current packages, verify archive sizes/SHA-256, then restore and run the two independent clients. The M3 client asserts 31 numerical/statistical probes; the exact quantity smoke succeeds without an invented probe count. No external or public claims.",
    "nextAction": "After the durable RS127 result, assess public API/ABI compatibility only against genuinely pinned historical binaries or qualify remaining independent consumers. Public NuGet, recipient migration, Discovery skill and a new roadmap still need explicit authorization.",
    "debtChanges": [
      "All thirteen local archives may be freshly qualified, but foundation receives no new source-free consumer test and full Math API coverage is not claimed.",
      "Current archive hashes and local consumers do not establish cross-version ABI or source compatibility, other-RID support or stable public semver.",
      "Three AURA/Decision/MCDM requests remain unsent, Math Discovery skill ungenerated and provider/release rights unapproved.",
      "Eight completed milestones and 541 native DWF nodes stay unchanged; RS127 creates no new project achievement or M8."
    ],
    "achievements": []
  },
